# Karpathy Guidelines

- Implement only requested behavior; avoid speculative layers and base classes.
- Keep domain contracts free of Android framework dependencies.
- Define behavior with JUnit before or alongside implementation.
- Run `gradle test lint assembleDebug`; use Android Studio for device-specific
  checks when the change requires them.
